WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:07.791
Digital collaboration around world cultural heritage begins with context, provenance, and respect for the relevant rights.

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:15.003
Record who holds the material, and the permitted uses, territories, duration, and scope for modification.

00:00:15.653 --> 00:00:25.461
Build a digital archive with sources, descriptions, versions, and attribution. Separate historical evidence, reconstruction, and contemporary creation.

00:00:26.111 --> 00:00:33.233
Start with one digital sample. Review the narrative and proposed use together before deciding whether to scale.

00:00:33.883 --> 00:00:41.417
Use the partnership link below to discuss maintenance, how value is shared, and how the project can support conservation.
